  "exit_condition": "Drop brightness-persist.patch when Ubuntu moves to gnome-shell 51 or later, or backports MR !4006 to 50.x. Drop brightness-auto-first-run.patch once upstream handles where automatic brightness starts on a monitor without a saved value, and brightness-no-edid.patch once upstream saves the brightness of a panel without an EDID. Until then, rebuild on every Ubuntu gnome-shell update and repeat the logout, login and reboot brightness check on both tablets."
